        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RKI Gibraltar Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Gibraltar Cabinet Pull Series offers unique beauty with new modern design. The gem-like design of the  Gibraltar Cabinet Pull gives off a custom cabinet look. The Gibraltar Pull is available in 3 inch cabinet pull length, a 5 inch cabinet pull length, 8 inch cabinet pull length, and a 10 inch cabinet pull length. Choose from kitchen hardware favorites like satin brass hardware or nickel colored cabinet pulls. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:<a href=\"/products/gibraltar-t-knob-rk-international-ck-725\"><b>Matching Gibraltar Cabinet Knob</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/gibraltar-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-8825\"><b>Gibraltar Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-825:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-826:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-827:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-828:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 11-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
